# (P5b SIG C) end starspire-hood
# (P5b SIG C) begin starspire-cowl: the Starspire stiff pointed cowl (T2 up, under the crown from T3): the gothic point, the collar, the star clasp
legend ; plume 2
legend < plume 3
legend = plume 4
legend > head 0
legend ? head 3
legend [ head 4
